{"screen_name": "Higanorio_rough", "file": "Higanorio_rough", "name": "日賀紀夫＠skebモノクロ垢", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1717138156129288192/sdrKl8Kz.jpg", "header_url": "", "description": "Skebのモノクロ絵垢です。(本垢：＠higanorio)\nNSFWおっけー。コメディ色強めのお絵描きしもす\nThis account is monochrome drawing on skeb.\nYou can request NSFW. Most of the plot will be comedy.", "total_works": 224, "scraped_works": 30, "first_seen": "2025-10-03T16:59:26.961619", "last_updated": "2025-10-10T18:58:29.966193", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 4000, "recorded_at": "2025-10-03T16:59:26.961619"}, {"amount": 8800, "recorded_at": "2025-10-10T18:58:29.966193"}], "comic": [{"amount": 7000, "recorded_at": "2025-10-03T16:59:26.961619"}, {"amount": 13200, "recorded_at": "2025-10-10T18:58:29.966193"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 8800, "comic": 13200}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 4000, "max": 8800}, "comic": {"min": 7000, "max": 13200}}, "links": [], "flags": {"from_archive": true}, "works": [{"path": "/@Higanorio_rough/works/224", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b96c4a89/uploads/origins/971ca6a2-8b98-46e4-8ba2-f6183bcf3aaa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=c43e07ba956bb3df354f15eecf512366", "thumbnail_srcset": "", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Higanorio_rough/works/223", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/cb78cd39/uploads/origins/83e2c015-f7b6-4220-9075-88d11dab9655?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=99e0194b804a2905d02c4807e41c868a", "thumbnail_srcset": "", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "こんにちは。\n前回うちの子「にぷら」を描いていただきありがとうございます。\n今回もこの子でお願いしたいです。\nhttps://skeb.jp/@Higanorio_rough/works/210\n\nあのあとたっぷりと弄られたにぷらはご主人にアナルを舐めてほしそうです。\n発情した表情で自分で尻肉を広げて見せています。今回は首輪以外全裸でお願いします。\n\nhttps://skeb.jp/@Higanorio_rough/works/106\n行為はこれとよく似ていますが、メインは正面から描い